            <strong class="text-white">Our managing directors bring more than ten years of experience in lab-container construction.</strong> Modular, BauO NRW-compliant, pharma-capable. We deliver flexible research environments for university medicine, universities, chemicals and the NRW life-science cluster — from the Albstadt works straight to Düsseldorf, via the A81 / A8 / A5 / A3.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base text-gray-400 mb-8">
            While others are still planning, you are already researching.
