    <!-- PROBLEM-AGITATION -->
    <section class="py-16 md:py-20">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold mb-10 text-slate-900">
            Planexus solves the three Düsseldorf bottlenecks at which laboratory projects regularly fail
          </h2>
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <div class="bg-slate-50 border-l-4 border-primary rounded-xl p-6">
              <div class="text-slate-900 font-bold text-lg mb-2">Rhine flooding forces pile foundations in the floodplain</div>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">The Düsseldorf gauge at river kilometre 744.2 reached its high of 10.69 m in 1995. Anyone planning containers at Hammer Deich, the harbour, Lörick or Niederkassel without sufficient elevation will not receive a permit from the Düsseldorf building-control office — Germany’s longest gauge record since 1816 is the design basis.</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-900 font-semibold mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-gray-200">Planexus response: Pile foundation or steel-frame elevation with height adjustment prepared at the factory.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-slate-50 border-l-4 border-primary rounded-xl p-6">
              <div class="text-slate-900 font-bold text-lg mb-2">Düsseldorf building control reviews strictly – BauO NRW 2018</div>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">The City of Düsseldorf building-control office at Brinckmannstraße 5 is competent for 10 city districts and more than 40 postcodes (40210 to 40629). Section 62 BauO NRW governs procedure-exempt works, but GMP, BSL-3 or installations over 75 m³ gross volume fall outside that exemption. A single formal error in the building notification means two to three weeks of standstill.</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-900 font-semibold mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-gray-200">Planexus response: Procedure-ready building documents for Düsseldorf building control at first submission.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-slate-50 border-l-4 border-primary rounded-xl p-6">
              <div class="text-slate-900 font-bold text-lg mb-2">The pharma corridor demands GMP, ATEX and BSL from one platform</div>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">The chemicals and consumer-goods industry in Holthausen, molecular diagnostics in Hilden, the central laboratory of a university hospital in Bilk and a large-scale research centre on the NRW border demand a single supply spectrum: GMP cleanroom to EU Annex 1, ATEX zoning 1/21 for solvents, BSL-2/-3 to BioStoffV and IQ/OQ/PQ documentation. Anyone who has to coordinate three manufacturers loses four weeks per handover.</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-900 font-semibold mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-gray-200">Planexus response: One LABtoGO platform, all four configurations, one contact.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- STRATEGISCHE FUSION INTRO -->
    <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold mb-8 text-slate-900">
            Lab containers for Düsseldorf: what the NRW pharma corridor, the Rhine floodplain and university medicine demand of the engineering
          </h2>
          <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-700 space-y-6">
            <p>
              <strong>Düsseldorf is the control centre of the North Rhine-Westphalian life-science corridor.</strong> Across 217 square kilometres and ten city districts, the consumer-goods and chemicals industry in Holthausen, a university hospital on a generous campus in Bilk, a research-intensive university with five faculties and the neighbouring molecular-diagnostics cluster in Hilden, the chemicals and pharma industry in the southern hinterland and a large-scale research centre some 75 km to the west compete for land, permits and engineering capacity. Anyone ordering a container laboratory here is not buying a standard product — they are buying site intelligence for Germany’s most research-intensive federal state, with more than 500 life-science companies.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>We know this market in detail.</strong> We know that the Düsseldorf building-control office at Brinckmannstraße 5 is competent for the building notification under BauO NRW 2018, and that Section 62 defines procedure-exempt works for containers up to 75 m³ gross volume. We know that the Düsseldorf gauge at river kilometre 744.2 with gauge zero +24.529 m NHN has been observed since 1816 and reached 10.69 m in 1995 — siting in the Rhine floodplain requires a pile foundation or steel-frame elevation above the local flood-protection line. We know that under DIN EN ISO 12944-2 Düsseldorf falls into corrosivity category C3 (urban atmosphere, about 75% mean humidity) and locally C4 near the harbour — not C5-M like maritime sites. These details are not in our quotation — they are the engineering foundation of every container that leaves our Albstadt works.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>Made in Albstadt, turnkey in Düsseldorf.</strong> Final assembly and interior fit-out are carried out with Wesemann furniture at our own works — a factory visit can be planned from either side. North on the A81, west on the A8, north on the A5 via Karlsruhe, the A3 from the Frankfurt interchange towards Cologne and the A57 or A46 into the Düsseldorf city area, the heavy-goods distance is around 480 kilometres; the Düsseldorf-Wersten (A46), Düsseldorf-Hafen (A52) and Düsseldorf-Mörsenbroich (A52) junctions are standard delivery points for Bilk, Holthausen, Hilden and Düsseldorf harbour.
            </p>
            <p>
              Whether you need a <strong>mobile laboratory Düsseldorf</strong> for a time-limited refurbishment phase at a university hospital, a <strong>modular lab container Düsseldorf</strong> for a permanent pharma expansion in Holthausen or Hilden, or a <strong>container laboratory Düsseldorf</strong> with BSL-3 containment for university-medical research — we deliver all three answers from the same platform: the LABtoGO from our Albstadt works.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ANWENDUNGSBEREICHE DÜSSELDORF -->
    <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-900 text-white">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
          <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
            <div class="text-primary font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Düsseldorf applications</div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold mb-4">Eight applications for lab containers in Düsseldorf</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg">Each area with a concrete Düsseldorf site and industry reference.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
            <div class="bg-slate-800/60 rounded-xl p-5 border border-slate-700 hover:border-primary/40 transition-colors">
              <div class="text-primary text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">01</div>
              <div class="font-bold mb-1">Consumer-goods chemistry</div>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Consumer-goods and adhesives industry in Holthausen, adhesive technology, personal care – cleanroom, ATEX zoning 1/21</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-slate-800/60 rounded-xl p-5 border border-slate-700 hover:border-primary/40 transition-colors">
              <div class="text-primary text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">02</div>
              <div class="font-bold mb-1">Molecular diagnostics</div>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Molecular diagnostics in Hilden, BSL-2 diagnostic laboratories, cleanroom production of molecular reagents</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-slate-800/60 rounded-xl p-5 border border-slate-700 hover:border-primary/40 transition-colors">
              <div class="text-primary text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">03</div>
              <div class="font-bold mb-1">University medicine</div>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">University hospital in Bilk, generous campus, interim laboratories during hospital refurbishments, KhBauVO NRW-compliant</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-slate-800/60 rounded-xl p-5 border border-slate-700 hover:border-primary/40 transition-colors">
              <div class="text-primary text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">04</div>
              <div class="font-bold mb-1">University research</div>
